; Delay-load surface for winhttp.dll - used ONLY by the opt-in update check,
; which is off by default. Keeping it out of the static import table means the
; loader does not page winhttp (and its dependencies) in on every launch.
; dlltool builds a delay-import library from this; see the Makefile.
LIBRARY winhttp.dll
EXPORTS
WinHttpCloseHandle
WinHttpConnect
WinHttpOpen
WinHttpOpenRequest
WinHttpQueryDataAvailable
WinHttpQueryHeaders
WinHttpReadData
WinHttpReceiveResponse
WinHttpSendRequest
